    "description": "Revisiting Central Bank\u2019s growth role: With its nominal policy powers, it cannot promote growth even if it wants to do so",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Revisiting-Central-Bank-s-growth-role-With-its-nominal-policy-powers-it-cannot-promote-growth-even-if-it-wants-to-do-so/4-792043",
