    "chunk_size_bytes": 1696,
    "chunk_text": "Amana Takaful\u2019s Medical Claims Team recognized for excellence\n\nAmana Takaful Insurance\u2019s Medical Claims team has been recognized at the\u00a0CPM Best Management Practices Company (BMPC) Awards 2026, highlighting excellence in management practices and operational performance.\n\nAt this year\u2019s awards, Amana Takaful Insurance was ranked among the\u00a0Top Forty Outstanding Companies\u00a0and recognized as the\u00a0Sector Winner in the General Insurance (Private Sector) category, reflecting the strength of its operational framework and disciplined execution.\n\nThis recognition underscores the company\u2019s continuous efforts to enhance its claims management processes through structured workflows, process optimization, and the integration of digital capabilities. These initiatives have contributed to improved efficiency, faster turnaround times, and a more seamless customer experience.\n\nCommenting on the achievement,\u00a0Siva Karthigun, Chief Executive Officer \u2013 General, stated:\n\n\u201cWe are encouraged by this recognition, which reflects the strength of our management practices and the consistent effort demonstrated by our Medical Claims team. Their commitment to maintaining high standards, improving efficiencies, and delivering a reliable and transparent claims experience has been instrumental in achieving this milestone.\u201d\n\nRupee volatility exposes deeper structural weaknesses, says fintech industry leader\n\nStrong economies need strong banks: Building the system Sri Lanka\u2019s next decade will need\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
