    "md5": "46f4163b72f1020c4ff70f94342df9f5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1523,
    "chunk_text": "Deshini Abeyewardena joins Cable Solutions Board\n\nCable Solutions PLC has appointed Deshini Abeyewardena to its Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.\n\nAbeyewardena is a Chartered and Management Accountant with experience in corporate governance, strategic consultancy, business development and public sector reform across a range of industries. Her career spans leadership roles in both the public and private sectors, with work focused on organisational restructuring, sustainability and institutional development.\n\nShe currently serves as a Non-Executive Director of Resus Energy PLC, where she chairs the Audit Committee and is a member of the Related Party Transaction Board Committee, contributing to the strategic planning and governance of the Colombo Stock Exchange-listed renewable energy company. She is also Honorary Director and Chair of Environmental Foundation (Guarantee) Ltd., overseeing interdisciplinary teams working on conservation initiatives, public interest litigation and environmental policy development.\n\nBetween 2022 and 2023, Abeyewardena served as a Senior Consultant at Deloitte Consulting LLC, leading a multidisciplinary team on a USAID-funded project aimed at improving public sector efficiency and resource management for the Government of Sri Lanka. Earlier, from 1996 to 2002, she was Senior Manager and Director at the Public Enterprises Reform Commission, where she directed the privatisation of 14 State-Owned Enterprises and coordinated financial sector reform initiatives."
  },
