    "chunk_text": "Between 2022 and 2023, Abeyewardena served as a Senior Consultant at Deloitte Consulting LLC, leading a multidisciplinary team on a USAID-funded project aimed at improving public sector efficiency and resource management for the Government of Sri Lanka. Earlier, from 1996 to 2002, she was Senior Manager and Director at the Public Enterprises Reform Commission, where she directed the privatisation of 14 State-Owned Enterprises and coordinated financial sector reform initiatives.\n\nAbeyewardena additionally worked as Manager of the Premier Centre at HSBC from 2006 to 2007, overseeing the bank\u2019s premier customer portfolio and service standards, and as Manager Public Relations at Sri Lankan Airlines Ltd. from 2002 to 2006, where she developed global public relations strategies and helped establish the airline\u2019s charitable trust, \u2018Sri Lankan Cares.\u2019\n\nShe is a Fellow of the Chartered Institute of Management Accountants (FCMA), UK, and an Associate of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka (ACA). She also completed her chartered training at Ernst & Young, focusing on statutory audits and systems evaluation."
