    "description": "Fuel crisis, global conflict and market abuse: Why Govt. must control unreasonable construction material prices",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Fuel-crisis-global-conflict-and-market-abuse-Why-Govt-must-control-unreasonable-construction-material-prices/4-792129",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
