    "chunk_text": "Yesterday, the nation marked the war heroes who paid with their lives and limbs so that the next generation could live in peace.\u00a0 A total of\u00a0 6,261 military personnel died in the fourth Eelam war, and 29,551 were wounded.\u00a0 28,708 military personnel died between 1983 and 2009. Many thousands were wounded. Thousands of civilians perished, disappeared and were wounded.\u00a0 Two generations of Tamil children were offered in zombie sacrifice in a nihilistic campaign of terror.\n\nThe least any government could do is to make sure that the hard earned peace would not be shattered within its term."
