    "description": "A critique of the \u2018Tobacco-Free Generation\u2019 policy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/A-critique-of-the-Tobacco-Free-Generation-policy/14-792142",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
