    "description": "Build SL Housing & Construction Exhibition opens on 22 May",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Build-SL-Housing-Construction-Exhibition-opens-on-22-May/273-340763",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1779297067.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-05-20-dailymirrorlk-d36543a5-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "e342789c8a6e8a26207863d1b08c8c0c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1114,
    "chunk_text": "Build SL Housing & Construction Exhibition opens on 22 May\n\nThe 21st Build SL Housing & Construction International Exhibition which has now become the premier exhibition of the construction industry in Sri Lanka, will be held from May 22nd to 24th, 2026, at the Sirimavo Bandaranaike Memorial Exhibition Centre of the BMICH.\n\nThis exhibition is held at a time when the construction industry is beginning to rise after continuous contractions from March 2020 to December 2023, due to the economic debacle resulting in the suspension of capital works of the government. It is also at a time of uncertainty due to the war in Persian Gulf.\n\nThis year, the exhibition is organized under the theme \u2018Realigning our construction for Tomorrow\u2019. It is organized by the Chamber of Construction Industry of Sri Lanka (CCI), which is incorporated by an Act of Parliament, as the apex representative body of all who are engaged in the construction sector.\n\nThe ceremonial inauguration by Bimal Rathnayake, Minister of Transport, Highways, Ports and Civil Aviation, and Urban Development will be held at 10.00 am on May 22nd."
  },
