    "md5": "00994b23409ad4d64448517c85700c87",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1085,
    "chunk_text": "Australasian NCAP (ANCAP) is the independent safety authority for the Asia-Pacific region, conducting assessments applicable to Australia, New Zealand, and other participating countries across South-East Asia, including Sri Lanka. Operating in alignment with Euro NCAP protocols, ANCAP assesses vehicles under the same rigorous criteria, ensuring that safety ratings earned in the Asia-Pacific market reflect the highest international standards.\n\nComplementing this achievement, the OMODA E5, C9, and C5 have also earned five-star Euro NCAP safety ratings, further strengthening Hayleys Mobility\u2019s portfolio of globally recognised, safety-first vehicles.\n\n\u201cAchieving five stars in Euro NCAP and ANCAP is the validation of every engineering decision built into this vehicle,\u201d said Suraj Chularathne, Assistant General Manager of Hayleys Mobility. \u201cFor us, safety is a non-negotiable standard. These vehicles prove that you do not have to compromise on elegance or performance to drive something genuinely safe, and we are proud to be the company delivering that to Sri Lanka.\u201d"
