    "chunk_text": "The development features clear approved deeds, well-developed 20ft road access and a peaceful environment within a rapidly appreciating suburban corridor. Land pricing starts from Rs.1.2 million per perch, positioning the project competitively within a high-demand growth zone.\n\nPiliyandala-Polgasowita continues to show excellent real estate appreciation potential due to increasing urban expansion around the Kahathuduwa Interchange and rising demand for well-connected residential land. With a limited and carefully curated offering, The Infinity is well-positioned to capitalise through this trajectory.\n\nSite visits are now open, with only a limited number of plots available."
