    "description": "SLT-Mobitel-Peradeniya Uni pioneer SL\u2019s 1st AI-integrated engineering degree",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/SLT-Mobitel-Peradeniya-Uni-pioneer-SLs-1st-AI-integrated-engineering-degree/215-340883",
