    "chunk_size_bytes": 930,
    "chunk_text": "Chaudhary meets CB Governor\n\nNepalese billionaire investor Dr. Binod Chaudhary recently called on Central Bank of Sri Lanka Governor Dr. Nandalal Weerasinghe to discuss the progress of his investments in Sri Lanka and explore future opportunities in the country\u2019s financial services sector.\n\nThe discussions focused on Sri Lanka\u2019s evolving economic landscape, investor confidence and the potential for greater regional collaboration and private sector participation in financial services and related industries.\n\nDr. Chaudhary reaffirmed his continued interest in Sri Lanka as a strategic investment destination in South Asia.\n\nUnion Bank Chairman Dinesh Weerakkody and Deputy Chairman Nirvana Chaudhary also participated in the meeting alongside Dr. Chaudhary.\n\nThe engagement highlighted the importance of strengthening regional business partnerships and supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s ongoing economic recovery and growth agenda."
