    "chunk_text": "SLIM President Enoch Perera stated, \u201cAs we celebrate the NSA\u2019s 25th anniversary, we are pleased to recognise a significant milestone in honouring Sri Lanka\u2019s sales professionals who continue to propel businesses and the economy ahead.\u201d\n\nSLIM Vice President Education and Research Manthika Ranasinghe emphasised, \u201cSeeing so many SLIM Sales Diploma graduates contribute significantly to the sales community\u2014some even going on to serve as the NSA jurors\u2014is incredibly inspiring.\u201d\n\nSLIM NSA 2026 Deputy Head of Jury Jerome Jayasinghe highlighted, \u201cThe NSA has evolved into Sri Lanka\u2019s most prestigious platform for recognising excellence within the sales fraternity and the 25th anniversary marks a significant milestone in that journey.\u201d\n\nSLIM NSA 2025 Project Chairman Damith Jayawardana stated, \u201cAs we celebrate this silver jubilee, NSA 2026 stands as both a tribute to the resilience and contribution of sales professionals and an ongoing commitment to enhancing the importance of the profession.\u201d\n\nSLIM CEO Chamil Wickramasinghe added, \u201cIn addition to inspiring and empowering the upcoming generation of sales leaders to propel growth and innovation across industries, the NSA has been a benchmark for excellence, professionalism, and performance for 25 years.\u201d"
