    "description": "PUCSL flags operational, environmental and financial risks linked to Lakvijaya coal shipments",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/PUCSL-flags-operational-environmental-and-financial-risks-linked-to-Lakvijaya-coal-shipments/34-792289",
    "lang": "en",
