    "chunk_text": "Warrant issued for Basil Rajapaksa\n\nColombo, May 22 (Daily Mirror) - Matara Chief Magistrate Chaturanga Eranga Dissanayake has issued a warrant for the arrest of former Minister Basil Rajapaksa.\n\nThe Magistrate ordered the warrant after Rajapaksa failed to appear before the court in connection with an ongoing case.\n\nThe case, filed by the Police Financial Crimes Investigation Division, involves the purchase of a one-and-a-half-acre land plot at Brown\u2019s Hill, Eliyakanda Road, Matara.\n\nCounsel for Rajapaksa submitted medical reports to the court, stating that the former minister is currently abroad receiving treatment for an illness.\n\nHowever, the Magistrate, noting that Rajapaksa has repeatedly failed to appear in court, ruled that a warrant be issued for his arrest."
