    "chunk_text": "Destroy cigarette haul in Kerawalapitiya\n\nA consignment of foreign-made cigarettes worth over Rs. 383 million, seized by Sri Lanka Customs at the Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayake, while being illegally brought into the country, was destroyed at the Western Power Plant in Kerawalapitiya. Pix by Nimalsiri Edirisinghe"
