    "chunk_size_bytes": 1744,
    "chunk_text": "Bingxue Sri Lanka opens first outlet in Dehiwala\n\nICETALK TIME (PVT) LTD Chairman Errol Weerasinghe, Executive Director Nivran Weerakoon and Director/General Manager Isaac Wangat the ceremonial ribbon-cutting\n\nBingxue Sri Lanka officially marked a significant milestone with the opening of its first local outlet in Dehiwala on 16 May, introducing the globally recognized dessert and beverage brand Bingxue to the Sri Lankan market for the very first time.\n\nThe launch represents a key step in the brand\u2019s regional expansion and signals the beginning of a new chapter in Sri Lanka\u2019s rapidly evolving dessert and caf\u00e9 culture.\n\nLocated in the heart of Dehiwala, the newly opened outlet offers customers an immersive experience centered around Bingxue\u2019s signature range of ice creams, bubble teas, and refreshing beverages. Designed with a modern lifestyle concept, the outlet combines vibrant aesthetics with a customer-focused environment, aiming to appeal particularly to young consumers and families seeking premium yet affordable dessert and beverage options.\n\nThe grand opening ceremony was attended by Errol Weerasinghe \u2013 Chairman of ICETALK TIME (PVT) LTD, Nivran Weerakoon \u2013 Executive Director of ICETALK TIME (PVT) LTD, and Isaac Wang \u2013 Director / General Manager of ICETALK TIME (PVT) LTD, together with invited guests, business partners, and well-wishers celebrating the official debut of Bingxue in Sri Lanka.\n\nBingxue\u2019s global journey began in China in 2014 under Jinan Baodao Enterprise Management Consulting Co., Ltd., and has since expanded rapidly. Today, the brand operates in more than 14 countries and continues to grow as one of the most recognizable names in the new-generation dessert and beverage industry."
  },
