    "description": "Allianz Lanka promotes Road Safety Awareness among three-wheeler drivers",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Allianz-Lanka-promotes-Road-Safety-Awareness-among-three-wheeler-drivers/273-340993",
    "lang": "en",
