    "chunk_text": "\u200bThe launch event was held under the patronage of Acting Ambassador of the Netherlands to Sri Lanka Iwan Rutjens and was attended by high-profile officials including Plantation Industries Ministry Secretary Gunadasa Samarasinghe.\u00a0 Rutjens has been actively championing the shift towards climate-resilient and ethical practices within the global tea industry.\n\nReflecting on the launch, Zaman noted that the integration of artificial intelligence and digital solutions would support the farmers not only in Sri Lanka but globally. By bridging these advanced technological tools with tangible operational benefits, the stakeholders are optimistic that the local tea sector can turn climate-related crises into strategic commercial opportunities, securing a resilient and prosperous future for the smallholders."
